       "text": "Devstream #195 - Unannounced 2026 Update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s time, Tenno. Join the Devstream crew on April 24th for Devstream #195 and experience the official world premiere of our Unannounced 2026 Update! What’s the Update name? What month will it arrive? What’s it all about?! You’ll learn it all. Get ready to expect the unexpected…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Watch live from start to finish and earn yourself the following Twitch Drops: an Omni Forma (Built) and one Tauforged Archon Shard (Crimson, Azure, or Amber) per 30 minute claim time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false
      },
      {
       "text": "See you at https://twitch.tv/warframe on Friday, April 24th at 2 PM ET!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false
      },
      {
       "text": "** We’re back to having a \\ouble Feature live-streaming day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Warframe Devstream 195: 2pm ET - 3pm ET",
       "ps5ProOnly": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Soulframe Devstream 13: 3:30 pm ET - 4:30 pm ET",
       "ps5ProOnly": false
      }
     ]
